"use strict";

/* generated from story/scenes/act1_ch2.md — do not edit */

SC["a1c2_hierarchy"]={t:()=>SYS(`CHAPTER TWO — KITCHENS`)+P(`The Azure Cloud Sect that the lantern-paintings show ends three terraces up. Below that line is the sect that makes the paintings possible: the kitchens, the wood stores, the wash-yards, the night-soil road — a basement nation of four hundred souls who feed nine hundred cultivators and are seen by approximately none of them.`)+((G.f.beatFeng)?(P(`Word of what you did to Liu Feng arrived in the kitchens before you did. Nobody mentions it. But the boy who hands out wash-water in the mornings has started giving you the bucket without a crack in it, which down here is a parade.`)):(P(`Word of the Feng business arrived in the kitchens before you did. Nobody mentions it. Down here, taking a beating from the outer court isn't shame — it's weather. Everyone's been rained on.`)))+P(`You learn the country by carrying water through it. Auntie Tang's word ends arguments her cleaver doesn't need to. Two bowls of her white soup buy a favor; the brown soup is for everyone; the clear soup, you are warned in a whisper, you should pray never to be offered, because it means she's decided you're leaving — one way or another.`)+P(`And every tenth sack of millet, every eighth jar of oil, every twentieth bundle of spirit-herbs takes a quiet walk off the inventory before Qiu's brush records it. The whole basement knows. The whole basement has decided, collectively and wordlessly, that knowing is not their job.`)+((G.f.a1_rumor==="demon")?(P(`The kitchen children have a new game: dare each other to touch the demon-boy's sleeve and live. You pretend not to notice. The intelligence network this buys you is, frankly, excellent — the feared hear everything.`)):(((G.f.a1_rumor==="god")?(P(`A bowl of salt fish appears at your wash-station some mornings. The river god's son, it seems, has believers even on the mountain. You eat the offerings. The god won't mind. The god is you.`)):(((G.f.a1_rumor==="prince")?(P(`Bao has, naturally, told the entire basement you are a shipwrecked prince. You are now addressed as "Highness" by every scullion under twelve, with bows of escalating theatrical quality. It is the first thing in two worlds that has made you laugh until your ribs hurt.`)):("")))))),
 c:()=>[{id:"c0",l:`Learn the rules by their edges. Three weeks of eyes open.`,go:"a1c2_ledger"}]};

SC["a1c2_ledger"]={t:()=>P(`Bao finds you at the woodpile on his firewood runs, which have a way of routing past wherever you're working. Tonight he sits, produces a roll of oil-paper from his shirt, and unrolls it like a man showing you his soul.`)+P(`It is a betting book. Neat columns: disciple duels, sect examinations, which elder will fall asleep first at assembly. Odds in Bao's careful, self-taught numbers.`)+P(`“Firewood quota went up again,” he says, not quite an apology. “A copper here, a copper there — winter happens whether I'm ready or not.” He taps the page. “Tomorrow: Feng's cohort against the third-terrace sword class. Everyone's coin says the sword class walks it. But I watched them drill, and their senior brother favors his left knee like it's made of state secrets.”`)+P(`He looks at you sideways. “You see things. Everyone says so. So — in or out?”`),
 c:()=>[{id:"c0",l:`Stake your only coin on Bao's bad knee.`,do:()=>{G.f.a1_ledger_in="coin";G.bao++;note("Bao +1. The knee folds in the second exchange. Your copper becomes five.");},go:"a1c2_debt"},
  {id:"c1",l:`Stay out — but memorize the book. Odds are just another weave.`,do:()=>{G.f.a1_ledger_in="eyes";addStat("mind",1);note("You learn the basement's whole economy in one page of Bao's handwriting.");},go:"a1c2_debt"},
  {id:"c2",l:`Stay out, and tell him to be careful whose losses he records.`,do:()=>{addStat("heart",1);G.bao++;note("Bao +1. He pockets the book slower than he took it out.");},go:"a1c2_debt"}]};

SC["a1c2_debt"]={t:()=>P(`The jade tray dies on the last day of your second week.`)+P(`Little Su — youngest on the kitchen roster, small enough to walk under the chopping tables without ducking — is carrying it up to the third terrace when Feng's cohort comes down the stair four abreast. Nobody touches her. They just don't make room. The tray meets the balustrade, and four hundred years of some elder's ancestral celadon meets the flagstones.`)+P(`The arithmetic is short and everyone in the stairwell can do it: the tray is worth more than Su's indenture. The deficit gets sold down-mountain, and the deficit is wearing her face. Qiu is already coming up the stair with his brush out, and his expression is the worst thing you have seen on this mountain so far: not anger. Bookkeeping.`),
 c:()=>[{id:"c0",l:`Step forward. “The tray was in my hands. I tripped her.”`,do:()=>{G.tang+=2;G.f.a1_su_saved="blame";addStat("heart",1);note("Tang +2. Qiu docks your meals for a season and writes your name with relish. From the kitchen door, Auntie Tang watches you do it, and her cleaver goes quiet for one full breath.");},go:"a1c2_qiu"},
  {id:"c1",l:`Run the numbers out loud — the stairwell has eleven witnesses, the cohort walked four abreast against ordinance, and liability law on the mountain is older than Qiu.`,req:()=>(G.mind>=4),rq:"(needs Mind 4)",do:()=>{G.f.a1_su_saved="law";addIns(1);note("Qiu's brush hangs in the air. The cohort's seniors pay for the tray to make you stop talking. The basement memorizes your face.");},go:"a1c2_qiu"},
  {id:"c2",l:`Do nothing. Watch every line of how power moves when it's small and certain.`,do:()=>{G.f.a1_su_sold=true;addIns(1);note("+1 Insight, and a stone in your chest. Su is gone down-mountain by week's end. The kitchens do not talk about it, which is how you learn what the kitchens talking ever was.");},go:"a1c2_qiu"}]};

SC["a1c2_qiu"]={t:()=>P(`Qiu summons you to the counting room on a wet evening: a closet of ledgers where the air tastes like ink and arithmetic. He does not look up for a long moment — a technique, you understand, that works better on people who haven't died recently.`)+P(`“You count,” he says at last. “Faster than my abacus boy, who is my sister's son and counts like the abacus owes him money.” He turns a page. “Inventory, two evenings a week. Off the book. You'll eat better.”`)+P(`You look at the open ledger and understand you are being offered a tour of the skim from the inside — every tenth sack, every eighth jar, recorded in a hand that isn't supposed to exist.`)+((G.f.a1_su_sold)?(P(`On the ledger's last line, small and dry as a receipt: <i>One indenture, transferred down-mountain.</i> A girl, converted to handwriting.`)):("")),
 c:()=>[{id:"c0",l:`Take the work. Copy what you see. Every line of it.`,do:()=>{G.f.a1_qiu_books=true;addIns(1);note("Two evenings a week, you eat better and memorize a crime. The copies live in your head, where no one sweeps.");},go:"a1c2_night"},
  {id:"c1",l:`Refuse — loudly, in front of the abacus nephew.`,do:()=>{G.f.a1_qiu_refused="public";note("The nephew goes pale. Qiu goes pleasant, which is worse. By morning, Feng's cohort has unexplained new confidence and your buckets have new holes.");},go:"a1c2_night"},
  {id:"c2",l:`Refuse — quietly, with a bow, citing your unworthiness of trust.`,do:()=>{G.f.a1_qiu_refused="private";addStat("heart",1);note("Qiu studies you for a long moment, then writes one small mark beside your name. You are now inventory with an asterisk.");},go:"a1c2_night"}]};

SC["a1c2_night"]={t:()=>P(`The night of the new moon, the whole mountain turns out lanterns for some observance nobody bothers to explain to the basement, and the thousand steps become a river of rising lights.`)+P(`You watch from the kitchen yard with your hands still pruned from wash-water. Above you, nine hundred cultivators climbing toward something. Around you, the basement nation finishing its day — Auntie Tang counting her knives, Bao asleep against the warm chimney with soot on his chin, the long stone channels under the flagstones carrying their faint silver hum that nobody else seems to hear.`)+P(`You think: back home, the streetlights would be coming on about now.`)+P(`And then you hear it — what you just did. <i>Back home.</i> Past tense. Some clerk in your chest has quietly moved Earth to the archive shelf and filed this mountain, this basement, these people, under <i>current</i>.`)+P(`You're not ready to decide how you feel about that. The deciding, as it turns out, has a date already: three weeks in, there is a midnight coming with your name on it.`),
 c:()=>[{id:"c0",l:`Work. Sleep. Wait for the night the mountain shows you what it is.`,go:"c1_night"}]};